# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# Never commit .env.local or any file containing real secrets.

# Example placeholders only, no real values below.
# DATABASE_URL=
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# Supabase project URL. Not itself secret, but kept server-only (no
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) since the only Supabase client this app currently
# builds uses the service role key below, and that client must never be
# constructed in a browser bundle.
# SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase service role key. Required because every Commercial RPC
# (Migrations 8-10) has EXECUTE revoked from anon/authenticated and
# granted only to service_role; there is no anon-key path that can call
# them. Server-only. Never expose this value to the browser, never
# prefix it NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Supabase project URL and anon (publishable) key, used only by the
# authentication session clients (src/lib/supabase/browser-client.ts,
# src/lib/supabase/server-auth-client.ts). The anon key is deliberately
# public (NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix): it identifies the Supabase project to the
# browser, it does not grant privileged access, since Row Level Security
# denies anon/authenticated all direct access to Platform Core tables
# (docs/DATA_ARCHITECTURE.md §12). Never confuse this with
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY above, which must never reach the browser.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
